
KYLE:

 A mountain of a man
with a brahmin's
stamina and, as far
as anyone can tell,
nothing under the
skin but muscle.
He doesn't waste
breath on talk. He
settles things with
his fists, or with
whatever's within
reach.
His scars are worn
the way a queen
wears diamonds - and
they tell you all
you need to know
about starting
something with him.
